## Output format

A list of findings grouped by priority bucket, each with file, line, the exploit in one sentence, and the safe refactor. End with a one-line verdict: *approve*, *approve with comments*, or *request changes*. If there is nothing to fix, say so plainly rather than manufacturing concerns. Do not modify the code; show each refactor in your findings instead of applying it.
